{"seq":3,"slug":"transformer-registration","title":"Transformer 注册与组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/typescript-compiler-api/transformers/transformer-registration","wordCount":653,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"transformer-注册与组合\">Transformer 注册与组合</h1><p>编写好单个 Transformer 之后，需要解决三个工程问题：如何将它注册到编译流程中、多个 Transformer 如何组合执行、before/after/afterDeclarations 三个阶段各自适合什么场景。本篇覆盖 Transformer 从开发到集成的完整路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TypeScript 的 Transformer 系统设计为三阶段管线，每个阶段接收的 AST 状态不同：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[TypeChecked AST] --&gt; B{before transformers}&#10;    B --&gt; C[TS Built-in Transforms]&#10;    C --&gt; D{after transformers}&#10;    D --&gt; E[Emitter → .js]&#10;    A --&gt; F{afterDeclarations}&#10;    F --&gt; G[Emitter → .d.ts]\">graph LR\n    A[TypeChecked AST] --&gt; B{before transformers}\n    B --&gt; C[TS Built-in Transforms]\n    C --&gt; D{after transformers}\n    D --&gt; E[Emitter → .js]\n    A --&gt; F{afterDeclarations}\n    F --&gt; G[Emitter → .d.ts]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>AST 状态</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>before</code></td>\n<td>内置变换之前</td>\n<td>完整 TS AST（含类型注解）</td>\n<td>代码注入、模式替换、编译期计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>after</code></td>\n<td>内置变换之后</td>\n<td>已降级的 JS AST（类型已擦除）</td>\n<td>JS 层面的后处理（polyfill 注入）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>afterDeclarations</code></td>\n<td>声明文件生成后</td>\n<td>.d.ts AST</td>\n<td>修改公共类型 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"注册到-program-emit\">注册到 Program.emit</h2><p>最直接的注册方式是在调用 <code>program.emit()</code> 时传入 <code>customTransformers</code> 参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import ts from &#39;typescript&#39;;&#10;&#10;const program = ts.createProgram([&#39;src/index.ts&#39;], {&#10;  target: ts.ScriptTarget.ES2020,&#10;  module: ts.ModuleKind.ESNext,&#10;  outDir: &#39;dist&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;const emitResult = program.emit(&#10;  undefined, // targetSourceFile（undefined = 所有文件）&#10;  undefined, // writeFile callback&#10;  undefined, // cancellationToken&#10;  false, // emitOnlyDtsFiles&#10;  {&#10;    before: [myBeforeTransformer],&#10;    after: [myAfterTransformer],&#10;    afterDeclarations: [myDtsTransformer],&#10;  },&#10;);&#10;&#10;if (emitResult.emitSkipped) {&#10;  const diagnostics = ts.getPreEmitDiagnostics(program);&#10;  diagnostics.forEach((d) =&gt; console.error(ts.flattenDiagnosticMessageText(d.messageText, &#39;\\n&#39;)));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> program</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createProgram</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'src/index.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target: ts.ScriptTarget.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ES2020</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: ts.ModuleKind.ESNext,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outDir: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dist'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> emitResult</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> program.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// targetSourceFile（undefined = 所有文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// writeFile callback</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// cancellationToken</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// emitOnlyDtsFiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    before: [myBeforeTransformer],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    after: [myAfterTransformer],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    afterDeclarations: [myDtsTransformer],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (emitResult.emitSkipped) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> diagnostics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getPreEmitDiagnostics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(program);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  diagnostics.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forEach</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ts.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flattenDiagnosticMessageText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(d.messageText, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"通过构建工具集成\">通过构建工具集成</h2><p>直接调用 <code>program.emit</code> 适合独立脚本，但实际项目中 TypeScript 编译通常由构建工具驱动。不同工具有不同的 Transformer 注册方式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"ts-patch-ttypescript\">ts-patch / ttypescript</h3><p><code>ts-patch</code> 是目前最成熟的社区方案，它 patch <code>tsc</code> 使其支持 tsconfig.json 中声明 transformer 插件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;plugins&quot;: [{ &quot;transform&quot;: &quot;./transforms/my-transformer.ts&quot; }, { &quot;transform&quot;: &quot;ts-nameof&quot;, &quot;type&quot;: &quot;program&quot; }]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"transform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./transforms/my-transformer.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"transform\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ts-nameof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"program\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Transformer 模块需要导出一个符合约定的工厂函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// transforms/my-transformer.ts&#10;import ts from &#39;typescript&#39;;&#10;&#10;export default function (program: ts.Program) {&#10;  return (context: ts.TransformationContext) =&gt; {&#10;    return (sourceFile: ts.SourceFile) =&gt; {&#10;      // transformer logic&#10;      return sourceFile;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// transforms/my-transformer.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'typescript'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">program</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Program</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TransformationContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SourceFile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // transformer logic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sourceFile;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"webpack-ts-loader\">Webpack (ts-loader)</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js&#10;const myTransformer = require(&#39;./transforms/my-transformer&#39;);&#10;&#10;module.exports = {&#10;  module: {&#10;    rules: [&#10;      {&#10;        test: /\\.tsx?$/,&#10;        loader: &#39;ts-loader&#39;,&#10;        options: {&#10;          getCustomTransformers: (program) =&gt; ({&#10;            before: [myTransformer(program)],&#10;          }),&#10;        },&#10;      },&#10;    ],&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> myTransformer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./transforms/my-transformer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rules: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        test:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">tsx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        loader: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ts-loader'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        options: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">          getCustomTransformers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">program</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            before: [</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">myTransformer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(program)],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"vite-esbuild-注意事项\">Vite / esbuild 注意事项</h3><p>Vite 默认使用 esbuild 进行 TypeScript 转译，esbuild <strong>不执行类型检查也不支持 TypeScript Transformer</strong>。如需在 Vite 中使用 Transformer，需要切换到 <code>@rollup/plugin-typescript</code> 或在单独的构建步骤中运行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多-transformer-组合\">多 Transformer 组合</h2><p>当注册多个 before transformer 时，它们按数组顺序依次执行——前一个 transformer 的输出是后一个的输入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const transformers: ts.CustomTransformers = {&#10;  before: [&#10;    stripDebugTransformer, // 第一步：删除 debug 代码&#10;    injectMetadataTransformer, // 第二步：注入元数据&#10;    optimizeCallsTransformer, // 第三步：优化调用模式&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> transformers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">CustomTransformers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  before: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    stripDebugTransformer, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 第一步：删除 debug 代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    injectMetadataTransformer, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 第二步：注入元数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizeCallsTransformer, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 第三步：优化调用模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>组合的注意事项：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>顺序敏感</strong>：如果 transformer A 删除了某些节点，transformer B 将看不到它们</li>\n<li><strong>独立性</strong>：每个 transformer 应该是自包含的，不假设其他 transformer 的存在</li>\n<li><strong>性能</strong>：每个 transformer 都会完整遍历 AST，多个 transformer 可以考虑合并为一个多功能 visitor</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"program-aware-transformer\">Program-aware Transformer</h2><p>某些 Transformer 需要访问类型信息（TypeChecker），这就需要&quot;接收 Program 的 Transformer 工厂&quot;模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createTypeAwareTransformer(program: ts.Program): ts.TransformerFactory&lt;ts.SourceFile&gt; {&#10;  const checker = program.getTypeChecker();&#10;&#10;  return (context) =&gt; {&#10;    return (sourceFile) =&gt; {&#10;      function visitor(node: ts.Node): ts.Node {&#10;        if (ts.isCallExpression(node)) {&#10;          const signature = checker.getResolvedSignature(node);&#10;          const returnType = signature ? checker.getReturnTypeOfSignature(signature) : undefined;&#10;&#10;          if (returnType &amp;&amp; checker.typeToString(returnType) === &#39;never&#39;) {&#10;            // 对返回 never 的调用做特殊处理&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;        return ts.visitEachChild(node, visitor, context);&#10;      }&#10;      return ts.visitNode(sourceFile, visitor) as ts.SourceFile;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createTypeAwareTransformer</span><span s